# Test: the SSH session editor refuses every commit form outside the grammar
# VALIDATES: spec-session-editor-file-mode-parity AC-25 -- with no window pending,
#            `commit accept` and `commit abort` say no confirmed commit is pending;
#            AC-27 -- `commit` alone and `commit bogus` name the subcommands,
#            `commit force` says force is a modifier, `confirm` and `confirm abort`
#            are unknown commands; AC-28 -- `commit accept force`, `commit abort
#            force` and `commit verify force` are refused, and outside `commit`
#            `force` is an ordinary value. Nothing reaches the running daemon until
#            `commit now`.
# PREVENTS: a typo or a legacy verb applying a configuration over SSH
option=timeout:value=60s

tmpfs=session-editor-commit-grammar.conf:terminator=EOF_CONF
system {
    authentication {
        user admin {
            password "$2a$04$UlwuiuH82Unfsq.XEMPGJeDkXwbm3KW.nvVaVXOd/JeFK8VjMjrQO"
        }
    }
}

environment {
    ssh {
        enabled true
        server main {
            ip 127.0.0.1;
            port $PORT2;
        }
    }
}

bgp {
    router-id 1.2.3.4
    session {
        asn {
            local 65000
        }
    }
    peer peer1 {
        connection {
            remote {
                ip 127.0.0.2
            }
            local {
                ip 127.0.0.1
                accept false
            }
        }
        session {
            asn {
                remote 65001
            }
        }
    }
}
EOF_CONF

tmpfs=session-editor-commit-grammar.script:terminator=EOF_SCRIPT
cli show bgp
has 1.2.3.4
send set bgp router-id 5.6.7.8
send commit accept
wait no confirmed commit is pending
send commit
wait commit needs a subcommand: commit now, commit confirmed <seconds>, commit accept, commit abort or commit verify
send commit abort
wait no confirmed commit is pending
send commit bogus
wait unknown commit subcommand "bogus": use commit now
send commit force
wait force is a modifier, not a subcommand
send confirm
wait unknown command: confirm
send commit accept force
wait commit accept takes no force: force overrides validation warnings or a conflict
send confirm abort
wait unknown command: confirm
send commit abort force
wait commit abort takes no force
send commit verify force
# The status line redraws only the tail after the prefix it shares with the line before.
wait verify takes no force
lacks 5.6.7.8
has 1.2.3.4
send set bgp peer peer1 description force
send commit now
wait Session committed: 2 change(s) applied
has 5.6.7.8
send show bgp peer peer1
wait description force
EOF_SCRIPT

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze start session-editor-commit-grammar.conf:timeout=60s
cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=le test fixture plugin/session-editor $PORT2 session-editor-commit-grammar.conf session-editor-commit-grammar.script:timeout=60s
expect=exit:code=0
expect=file:path=session-editor-commit-grammar.conf:contains=router-id 5.6.7.8
expect=file:path=session-editor-commit-grammar.conf:contains=description force
